      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that the consensus is against it, but you were kind of vague on what the actual evidence they cite is. like, what specific types of data or studies do they point to when they claim there's a genetic link to cognitive ability? i want to know the actual points they make so i can address them specifically.",
